================================================================================
  EXPERIMENT 3: Recursive compression
================================================================================

  Luma plane (1024x1024):
    Raw entropy:                            8.000 bpp
    After MED (1st round residuals):        4.620 bpp
    After 2nd MED (residuals of residuals): 5.278 bpp
    Gain from 2nd round:                    -0.658 bpp
    After 3rd MED (res of res of res):      6.062 bpp
    Gain from 3rd round:                    -0.784 bpp

    'Predict 0' on raw residuals:           4.620 bpp  (same as 1st round, obviously)

  Multi-resolution approach:
    Half-res (512x512) entropy: 5.319 bpp
    Detail residual entropy:                4.345 bpp
    Multi-res total: 5.319/4 + 4.345*3/4 = 4.589 bpp
    vs single-pass MED:                     4.620 bpp
    Gain from multi-res:                    +0.031 bpp

