  Luma(G)        raw:1,048,576  zlib-9: 658,649  entropy: 605,591  zlib/entropy:1.088x  zlib bpp:5.025
  Chroma(R-G)    raw:1,048,576  zlib-9: 379,290  entropy: 335,548  zlib/entropy:1.130x  zlib bpp:2.894
  Chroma(B-G)    raw:1,048,576  zlib-9: 454,258  entropy: 401,879  zlib/entropy:1.130x  zlib bpp:3.466

  (zlib/entropy > 1.0 means zlib wastes bits beyond the theoretical minimum)
  (GR typically matches or slightly exceeds zlib for Laplacian residuals)
